e. Finally.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Use code NEW10 for 10% off — stacks with 34% multibuy saving on four bags.\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":373538,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":3362,\"duplicates\":1,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":5,\"currentRank\":5,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":10.64},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1018311471256499\",\"collationId\":\"1369169025206658\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-27T01:20:14.308Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-26T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-27T02:15:52.696Z\",\"daysRunning\":62,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/758a912aed6b70182b71f8a05af0f92ecf4eee9a2981c361bdc5b617af674aee.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/1330f4798a4f28031e9ae696afd05d6225b4f0f38b1938e84383a790f149b861.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1106647162524028\",\"name\":\"Blood Sugar Balance Community\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1106647162524028.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1106647162524028\",\"liveAdsCount\":4312,\"reach30d\":1892898,\"totalReach\":3974228,\"countriesCount\":4,\"facebookLikes\":7770,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Looking to Support Healthy Blood Sugar Naturally? 🌿\\n\\nExperience the Power of Metabolae Sri Lankan Ceylon Cinnamon!\\n\\n✅ Helps support healthy blood sugar levels\\n✅ Supports steady daily energy\\n✅ Helps reduce blood sugar crashes\\n✅ Authentic Sri Lankan Ceylon cinnamon\\n✅ 200+ Clinical studies\\n✅ Enhanced with MCT oil for absorption\\n\\nSupport healthier glucose metabolism naturally with research-backed ingredients designed for daily stability!\",\"transcript\":\"If you bought Metabole on Amazon, you gotta fake. We don't sell there. You need to hear this. Not all the Ceylon cinnamon you see online is real, and some of it is faking our product. We're at our facility today because we've seen a huge spike in fake orders, and we need to clear the air. There are counterfeit versions of Metabole all over third-party sites. Some use our name, some copy our packaging, but none of them are the real thing. That's the reason so many diabetic men try Ceylon cinnamon for their blood sugar, expecting their fasting number to drop and their energy to come back, and end up feeling nothing at all a month later. First thing you should know, we do not sell on Amazon, Walmart, or any other marketplace. If it didn't come from our website, it didn't come from us. Second, the cheap stuff, whether it's a counterfeit or just Cassia from China dressed up as Ceylon, is a completely different species with no MHCP in it at all. On top of that, Cassia damages your liver at daily doses because of the Coumarin. You think you're getting the real thing, and you're getting the wrong plant entirely. Remember, if it isn't DNA verified Ceylon concentrated 12 to 1 and suspended in MCT oil, it was never strong enough to reach your cells and clear the trapped sugar. Third, the only way to guarantee you're getting real metabolic DNA verified Ceylon from Sri Lanka concentrated 12 to 1 and suspended in MCT oil. The concentration and delivery that actually reaches your cells and reactivates the receptors, is to order directly from the link below. Every order ships straight from our own facility, fast delivery right to your door. No third-party sellers, no middlemen, no guesswork. When you buy directly from us, your order is fully guaranteed. If you don't love it, we refund you 100%. No questions asked. Protect your blood sugar. Avoid the fakes and the wrong species. Only order the real thing by clicking the link below.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":278515,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":2507,\"duplicates\":26,\"reachDelta1d\":5230,\"reachDelta7d\":30544,\"reachDelta30d\":97274},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":3,\"currentRank\":3,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":0.07},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1750297399367042\",\"collationId\":\"1575062660485075\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T12:02:16.325Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-10-07T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-24T02:20:43.716Z\",\"daysRunning\":51,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/a620e6edf17bc48fa56572482ea6afe00af9349041151cfcf7b5898564fa900a.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/eae3fa6e3a7f09eaeca72382fb9cb76de429905e3d7c57fd97d5db7eb1664254.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1106647162524028\",\"name\":\"Blood Sugar Balance Community\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1106647162524028.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1106647162524028\",\"liveAdsCount\":4312,\"reach30d\":1892898,\"totalReach\":3974228,\"countriesCount\":2,\"facebookLikes\":7770,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Looking to Support Healthy Blood Sugar Naturally? 🌿\\n\\nExperience the Power of Metabolae Sri Lankan Ceylon Cinnamon!\\n\\n✅ Helps support healthy blood sugar levels\\n✅ Supports steady daily energy\\n✅ Helps reduce blood sugar crashes\\n✅ Authentic Sri Lankan Ceylon cinnamon\\n✅ 200+ Clinical studies\\n✅ Enhanced with MCT oil for absorption\\n\\nSupport healthier glucose metabolism naturally with research-backed ingredients designed for daily stability.\",\"transcript\":\"Linda? Hey, Renee. What is that? Lunch. Your chart says nothing by mouths. I know. Then you know you're not supposed to be eating anything. Just watch. Watch what? My numbers. You were over four hundred three days ago. I know. And you're eating pizza? Check me after. I'm putting this in your chart. Go ahead. Well? $1.18. That's good, right? After pizza, fries, and pudding, that doesn't make sense. What are you doing? Checking your wristband. You think I'm somebody else? I think something doesn't add up. Linda Carter? That's me. She thinks I switched rooms with somebody. Let's check it again. 01/21. Three days ago, you were over 400. Your blood sugar came in at four twelve. Your a one c is 11.2. That's not possible. I take my metformin every day. Six years. I haven't missed a dose. This has been building for a long time. My doctor says I'm managed. Nothing by mouth until we get you stabilized, then we'll talk about starting insulin. Insulin? Let's get you through tonight first. 04:12. I'm sorry. I didn't mean to wake you. You didn't. Hospitals don't let anyone sleep. I heard him say met for men. Six years. I did everything he told me. I know you did. I prescribed metformin for thirty four years. You're a doctor? Endocrinologist. Retired. I told thousands of women exactly what your doctor told you. Cut the carbs, take the pill, you're managed. And it didn't work for them either? Not for most of them. I watched them lose feeling in their feet, lose their kidneys. I adjusted doses and called it care. I never once told them why the number wouldn't come down because nobody ever taught me. Then how do you know now? Because at 70, it happened to me. My a one c hit 8.1 on my own protocol. And a young Sri Lankan fellow I'd trained sat me down and embarrassed me in my own office. What did he tell you? That I had been treating the wrong thing for thirty four years. Every cell in your body has doors. Insulin knocks, the doors open, the sugar leaves your blood. After enough years, those doors stop answering. The insulin is there, the sugar is there, nothing opens. So the sugar stays in my blood, trapped, moving with every heartbeat, grinding through the vessels in your feet first. Do they burn at night? For two years? Then your kidneys, your eyes, your heart, and the metformin I prescribed for thirty four years, it tells the liver to make less new sugar. It never opens a single door. I was turning down the faucet for thousands of women while the drain stayed clogged. Then what opens them? That's what he showed me. True sealant cinnamon. Cinnamon. I laughed, too. Then he showed me the research. Published in the American Diabetes Association's own journal, a compound called MHCP signals those stuck doors to respond to insulin again. The trapped sugar finally moves into the cells. A second compound, cinnamaldehyne, repairs the vessel lining. The sugar has been grinding through. I've tried cinnamon pills. From Amazon? Yes. Kaseya, different tree, from China. Almost none of the compound in coumarin that burdens your liver. And even real Ceylon in a dry capsule is worthless. The compounds are fat soluble. No oil, it passes straight through you. This is what I've taken every morning for eight years. Metabolet. True Ceylon from Sri Lanka, DNA Verifieded, Concentrated twelve one, seventy thousand two hundred milligrams in one soft gel. Suspended in MCT oil so it actually reaches your blood. What's your a one c now? 5.5 at 78 off the metformin for six years. Why isn't your old office telling people this? Because it isn't a prescription. There's no rep, no insurance code. Take one when they let you eat, then have them check you. Your numbers are stable enough to send you home. We're holding off on the insulin. Good. But Linda, this doesn't end when you walk out that door. Follow-up with me in thirty days. I will. What are you taking? Ask the woman who used to sleep there. She prescribed metformin for thirty four years. The hip replacement? The endocrinologist. The doctor from the hospital gave you that? The doctor in the next bed. Cinnamon? Not the kind you're thinking of. You're not napping? Haven't napped in a week. Gary, my feet stopped burning. When? I don't know. I just noticed they're quiet. Seven point one. My a one c? Seven 0.1. You came into my ER at eleven point two. In a month? Fasting glucose averaging 100 o four. Whatever you're doing, keep doing it. 5.9. 5.9? I've been doing this twenty years. I don't see this. Neither did she for thirty four years. I took my metformin every day for six years. My doctor called me managed at every appointment. Then I woke up in an ER with a blood sugar of 412. The only person who ever told me the truth was a retired endonologist in the bed next to mine. She'd prescribed metformin for thirty four years. She told me it never opened a single door. Metabolai is true Ceylon cinnamon from Sri Lanka. DNA verified, concentrated 12 to one, suspended in MCT oil so it actually reaches your blood. One soft gel every morning. Buy two, get one free right now with a ninety day money back guarantee. If your numbers don't move, you pay nothing. Tap the link below. Don't wait until you're the one in the hospital bed.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://metabolae.com/products/softgels-ceylon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"metabolae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":253254,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":2279,\"duplicates\":13,\"reachDelta1d\":1846,\"reachDelta7d\":9336,\"reachDelta30d\":33503},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":2,\"currentRank\":2,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":0.05},