{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UKS1KbmC1tRi4P7esR3Wp2","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"46428634-21ca-4c9d-a3b1-942775bb0290\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1008244711333042\",\"collationId\":\"1291053239367057\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-09-10T08:45:44.717Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2025-09-07T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2025-10-20T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":43,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/64bff851a4d74d85a92ebed40f1e8907b0313c7852e160a10041fdd3202f8b4b.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"104664022160394\",\"name\":\"Primal Remedies\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/104664022160394.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"104664022160394\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":390601,\"countriesCount\":56,\"facebookLikes\":555,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Ever wondered if those plants in your backyard had a purpose?\\nResearchers and herbal specialists have gathered a treasure trove of natural healing remedies—now available for you to explore!\\n🌿 What’s Inside:\\n ✅ Over 200 plants with time-tested traditional uses\\n ✅ Vivid, detailed images to help you recognize each plant\\n ✅ Pro tips on how to grow, harvest, and use them safely and effectively\\nRediscover the healing secrets hidden in plain sight!\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://primal-remedies.com/pages/discover-nhs-1\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Limited Time Offer : 73% OFF ⚠️\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Primal Remedies\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":83,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AG\",\"AI\",\"AM\",\"AR\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"AW\",\"AZ\",\"BB\",\"BE\",\"BG\",\"BH\",\"BJ\",\"BL\",\"BM\",\"BN\",\"BO\",\"BR\",\"BS\",\"BZ\",\"CA\",\"CF\",\"CG\",\"CI\",\"CK\",\"CY\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"EE\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GF\",\"GP\",\"HR\",\"HU\",\"IE\",\"IT\",\"LT\",\"LU\",\"LV\",\"MF\",\"MQ\",\"MT\",\"NL\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"RE\",\"RO\",\"SE\",\"SI\",\"SK\",\"YT\"],\"mainCountry\":\"MT\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":25,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_896295246121183\",\"collationId\":\"1228851462573511\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T08:47:31.571Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-01-18T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-04-12T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":84,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/da60e71cebed01f227d032992ae3637d0f3b87ce0c661432f695d318111fcb0a.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"795017747258532\",\"name\":\"The Primal Remedies\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/795017747258532.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"795017747258532\",\"liveAdsCount\":11,\"reach30d\":19,\"totalReach\":833453,\"countriesCount\":3,\"facebookLikes\":1013,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Looking for a natural way to support healthy blood sugar?\\nMost people don’t know there’s a huge difference between regular cinnamon and true Ceylon cinnamon.\\n\\nCeylon — used for centuries — contains far lower coumarin levels and is prized for its cleaner, gentler profile.\\n\\nPrimal Remedies Ceylon Cinnamon Softgels deliver a high-potency extract combined with premium MCT oil for superior absorption and real daily support.\\nTry it today risk-free for 60 days with our money-back guarantee.\\nhttps://primal-remedies.com/pages/adv1-news-cinnamon\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://primal-remedies.com/pages/adv1-news-cinnamon\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"OFFERS ENDS TODAY 23.59\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Primal Remedies\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":34351,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":309,\"duplicates\":73,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_2497912587398281\",\"collationId\":\"2036087593938678\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-16T00:21:32.390Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-15T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-29T13:34:46.670Z\",\"daysRunning\":73,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/082cddd71e952ebd4db3861af25062aa054e7e39b480dc25f9f0e512a0845eda.png\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"104036528380900\",\"name\":\"Deborah Washington\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/104036528380900.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"104036528380900\",\"liveAdsCount\":140,\"reach30d\":44570,\"totalReach\":112651,\"countriesCount\":4,\"facebookLikes\":379,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Here’s what nobody in black community gets told about how to take Ceylon cinnamon for blood sugar. And I say this as a Black ICU nurse who’s spent over three decades on the frontlines of metabolic health.\\n\\nBlood sugar is my thing. I’m Brenda Jackson, and after 34 years as an ICU nurse, I’ve watched how uncontrolled glucose disproportionately ravages Black families over decades. I’ve seen the nerve pain, the kidney damage, the constant exhaustion. I’ve watched the trajectory in my own family and in my patients.\\n\\nCeylon cinnamon is the most studied natural compound for blood sugar control on the planet. It doesn't just nudge your numbers down. It addresses why your cells stopped responding to insulin in the first place—the stubborn glucose buildup, the daily spikes, the crashes that follow.\\n\\nAnd here’s what hits home: it supports circulation and nerve function, too. So if you’re dealing with tingling in your feet, stiffness, or heavy afternoon fatigue on top of high blood sugar, you’re hitting multiple problems at once.\\n\\nBut here’s what the supplement industry hides from us.\\n\\nMost Ceylon cinnamon products are designed to look good on a store shelf, not to work in a body dealing with chronic metabolic stress. They sell you the wrong plant, in the wrong form, at the wrong dose. When your numbers don't move, they let you conclude that natural remedies don't work for our people. It's one of the most profitable lies in the wellness space—and Black diabetics pay the price.\\n\\nHere’s what they get wrong.\\n\\nA lot of people think any cinnamon supplement will do. That's true if you don't mind fake Cassia bark labeled as Ceylon.\\n\\nI learned this the hard way in my own life.\\n\\nMy fasting glucose had been running in the 180s for months. My A1C sat at 7.3 and wouldn't budge. I was doing everything right—cutting carbs, walking after dinner, taking my Metformin twice daily. Still losing ground.\\n\\nI’d wake up at 3 AM to check my glucose out of pure anxiety. Still 168. Lie there until morning, wondering why my body was fighting me. Brain fog by 2 PM every single shift. Exhausted before my rounds were halfway done.\\n\\nMy doctor kept saying, \\\"Just watch your diet better.\\\" Nothing was working.\\n\\nThen I tried Ceylon cinnamon. Ordered softgels online for $14.99. Took them for two weeks. My glucose dropped maybe 8 points. Better than nothing, but not the breakthrough I needed.\\n\\nSo I went back to the research and spoke with Black researchers in metabolic health. I found two massive problems the supplement industry never bothered to fix.\\n\\nThe first is species fraud.\\n\\n90% of cinnamon supplements are cheap Cassia from China, relabeled as Ceylon. Cassia costs a fraction of true Ceylon to source. The industry knows this, but they bottle it anyway. Cassia contains up to 250 times more coumarin—a compound known to cause liver stress with daily use. And it barely moves blood sugar.\\n\\nReal Ceylon from Sri Lanka has virtually zero coumarin and 12 times more of the active compounds that actually restore insulin response. Without DNA verification on the label, you’re taking a gamble.\\n\\nThe second problem is what most doctors never explain.\\n\\nThe active compound in Ceylon cinnamon is cinnamaldehyde. It works at the cellular level to restore how your cells respond to insulin. But cinnamaldehyde is fat-soluble. Without a lipid carrier, it cannot absorb. It passes right through your digestive tract completely unused.\\n\\nThe Journal of Food Science and metabolic research studies document this clearly: fat-soluble compounds in a dry powder capsule cannot cross cell walls. They reach your gut, find no fat carrier, and pass straight through.\\n\\nA softgel suspended in healthy oil costs significantly more to manufacture than a dry powder capsule. So companies keep selling you cheap dust and letting you think cinnamon failed you.\\n\\nIt works—they just never gave it a pathway to absorb.\\n\\nWrong species, wrong form, wrong results.\\n\\nWhen you use real Sri Lankan Ceylon cinnamon concentrated and suspended in MCT oil, your body handles it completely differently. The healthy oil carries cinnamaldehyde directly into your bloodstream, restoring insulin sensitivity and helping your cells process glucose properly.\\n\\nAfter 34 years of watching our community suffer from incomplete health advice, I don't compromise on what goes into my body. I took this data to Dr. Vance, one of the top Black endocrinologists in our hospital network, and he confirmed the exact same mechanism. That’s why I only use Primal Remedies.\\n\\nTrue Ceylon from Sri Lanka. DNA-verified. Concentrated 12:1, so one softgel equals 7,200mg of whole cinnamon. Suspended in MCT oil for maximum cellular absorption. Third-party tested, coumarin-free, non-GMO, and gluten-free. It comes in a light-blocking pouch, not a plastic bottle, keeping the active compounds fresh and stable.\\n\\nThe difference was night and day.\\n\\nDay three: I slept straight through the night. First time in over a year.\\n\\nWeek one: The 2 PM brain fog lifted. I had sustained energy through my entire 12-hour ICU shift.\\n\\nWeek two: My fasting glucose dropped from 184 to 141.\\n\\nWeek four: 116. I tested twice because I thought my monitor was wrong.\\n\\nThree months later, my A1C dropped from 7.3 to 5.7. My doctor was blown away and told me to keep doing exactly what I was doing.\\n\\nI take it every single morning now. Two years strong. No liver issues, no stomach irritation, no side effects—just steady energy, mental clarity, and blood sugar readings that give me peace of mind.\\n\\nI’ve recommended Primal Remedies to six of my patients and family members who were struggling with stubborn numbers. All six came back with the same relief: deeper sleep within days, clearer energy, and fasting glucose finally moving into a safe range.\\n\\nIf you’re dealing with:\\n\\nFasting glucose that stays high no matter what you eat\\n\\nMid-afternoon brain fog and energy crashes\\n\\nWaking up at 2 AM or 3 AM with anxious energy\\n\\nTingling or poor circulation in your feet\\n\\nAn A1C that won't budge despite Metformin or diet changes\\n\\nTry this: One softgel in the morning with breakfast. That's it.\\n\\nDon't waste money on cheap store-bought cinnamon. Most of it is fake Chinese Cassia loaded with coumarin, and dry powder capsules pass right through you without absorbing.\\n\\nIf you’re going to use Ceylon cinnamon, get the formula engineered to actually work: true Sri Lankan Ceylon, 7,200mg clinical equivalent, suspended in MCT oil.\\n\\nThat’s Primal Remedies. They offer a full 90-day money-back guarantee because they know the science stands up. If your numbers don't improve, you don't pay a single dime.\\n\\nIt’s the only one worth taking for real results.\\n\\nGive it a try and let me know how your numbers look in two weeks.\\n\\n~ Brenda Jackson, RN, ICU, 34 years\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://primal-remedies.com/pages/adv1-news-b\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Ceylon Cinnamon 7200mg Equivalent with MCT Oil\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Primal Remedies\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":3903,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":35,\"duplicates\":23,\"reachDelta1d\":0,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":0},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":5,\"currentRank\":5,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":3.57},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}}],\"pagination\":{\"page\":1,\"limit\":3,\"total\":12920,\"totalPages\":3333,\"offset\":0,\"isTotalApproximate\":true},\"meta\":{\"query\":\"primal-remedies.com\",\"keywords\":[],\"searchIn\":\"domain\",\"categoryIds\":[],\"country\":null,\"countryFilterKind\":\"audienceCountry\",\"adCountries\":null,\"mainCountries\":[],\"trendSignal\":\"reach_growth_7d\",\"sortBy\":\"mostDuplicates\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"requestedLimit\":3,\"effectiveLimit\":3,\"activeOnly\":true,\"status\":\"all\",\"page\":1,\"minTrafficGrowthPercent\":null,\"trafficGrowthPeriod\":\"last30d\",\"trafficGrowth\":null,\"adsGrowth\":null,\"pageReachGrowth\":null,\"adReachGrowth\":null,\"language\":null,\"adLanguages\":[],\"cta\":[],\"currency\":null,\"currencies\":[],\"shopifyAppIds\":[],\"excludeShopifyAppIds\":[],\"pixelIds\":[],\"excludePixelIds\":[],\"themeIds\":[],\"filters\":{\"search\":[\"p